# Internal working documents — must never be deployed or published.
# The site's deployable surface is public/ only; Cloudflare Pages is configured
# with public/ as the build output directory so nothing outside it can ship.
# CONTENT-PLAN.md contains candid strategy and business assessment.
CONTENT-PLAN.md
REVIEW-*.md
X-POSTS-DRAFT.md
# The daily X drafts. Written by a scheduled task every morning and edited by
# MyDash, never committed. Untracked, it would leave the tree dirty every day,
# and deploy.sh refuses to deploy a dirty tree.
PROMO.md

# Local wrangler dev state (created by `wrangler pages dev public`)
.wrangler/
node_modules/

# Bytecode from feed.py / modelfacts.py / check.py. Untracked, it leaves the
# working tree dirty, and deploy.sh guard 3 refuses to deploy a dirty tree — so
# running the generators would block the deploy they exist to prepare for.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS / editor noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# Secrets - never commit these
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.dev.vars
*.pem
*.key
